{% extends "base.jinja" %}
{% block content %}
<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">About TaxSaver India</h1>
  <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6">TaxSaver India provides free, accurate tax calculators and expert guides for Indian taxpayers.</p>
  <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
    <p>Our mission is to make Indian tax law understandable and accessible to every taxpayer — whether you're a salaried employee trying to pick the right regime, a freelancer figuring out advance tax, or a business owner navigating GST.</p>
    <p>All calculators are updated within hours of every Union Budget announcement. Tax data is sourced directly from the Income Tax Act, CBDT circulars, and Finance Bills.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-8">Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>Results from our calculators are estimates only and are not tax or legal advice. Please consult a Chartered Accountant (CA) for your specific tax situation.</p>
  </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
